      "widgets_values": [
        "Anime cel-shaded action sequence, 2D hand-drawn look with bold clean linework, vivid saturated colors, dramatic rim lighting and speed lines. Hero: a muscular green alligator warrior with a scarred snout, amber eyes, a tattered crimson scarf and bronze shoulder armor, standing atop a rain-soaked rooftop at night above a neon city.\n\nTimeline:\n[0s-1.5s] Low hero shot, the alligator plants his feet as rain streaks past, scarf whipping, neon signage glowing behind him.\n[1.5s-3s] He snaps his head toward camera and bares his teeth, a determined grin, lightning flashing to backlight him in stark silhouette.\n[3s-4s] He drops into a fighting stance and slams one clawed fist into an open palm, impact sparks scattering.\n[4s-5.2s] Slow push in on his face, eyes narrowing with resolve as rain runs down his scales and the neon flickers.\n\nContinuous camera, no cuts, no dissolves. Consistent character design throughout, exactly one alligator in frame.\n\nAudio: heavy rain on rooftop tiles, low rolling thunder at 1.5s, a sharp orchestral brass hit landing on the fist slam at 3.4s, and a driving taiko drum pulse underneath that builds to the final second. A single low reptilian growl at 2s. No speech, no dialogue, no narration.",
        864,
        480,
        124
      ]
